{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_purge_model_dir", "label": "A Purge That Removes the Model Directory", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "PgBlobs::reap unlinks the content-addressed path, which since the folder tree is only the address of files migrate_storage has not reached. Nothing is lost, which is the right way round for this area to fail; what breaks is the promise that bytes are kept 30 days and then deleted."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_quarantined_file_table", "label": "quarantined_file table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Keyed on the store-relative path, not on blob: blob is one row per hash and source dedup is gone, so one hash can be several model files with several independent lifetimes and a per-hash column could describe at most one of them. No foreign key to blob, because a blake3 column that refused to outlive its blob row would lose the only record of the path. The index is plain, not partial, because every row is quarantined by construction."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_migration_0014", "label": "Migration 0014 \u2014 quarantined_file", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_clock_belongs_to_bytes", "label": "The Clock Belongs to the Bytes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "A hash identifies its bytes, so a second purge touching an already-quarantined blob must not restart the hold; a path does not identify its bytes, so on conflict the clock restarts. Reaching the conflict takes a person, and what puts it back in play is the store being browsable \u2014 delete the model directory in a file manager, re-scan, purge again, and the same path arrives holding different bytes."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_unlink_before_commit", "label": "Unlink Before Commit, and Only the File Is Fatal", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "A sweep that committed first would leave bytes with no row at all, which nothing would ever collect. File first means every partial state is 'the bytes are gone, the tidying is not finished', which the next sweep completes; removing metadata.json first would leave a directory holding bytes and no manifest, which reads as an orphan to anything walking the store."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_remove_dir_if_empty", "label": "remove_dir_if_empty \u2014 Non-Fatal", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Removing what the owner left in a directory they were promised they could edit is the data loss reaping exists to prevent; failing the sweep over it stops every other removal for as long as that file sits there. It is left reporting rather than insisting, because moving the decision into the function would take it away from both callers."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_phantom_blob_bytes", "label": "Phantom Blob Bytes in Both Reports", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "For a migrated source the blob row's stored_bytes describes a path migrate_storage emptied, so purge and reap count it twice over: 22,660 reported freed against 12,976 that actually left the volume. Left alone because correcting it means deciding what a blob row's size means for a hash with no content-addressed copy \u2014 the same question storage_totals defers \u2014 and the figure reaches an operator log and no user-facing string."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_purge_model_dir", "target": "specs_2026_09_06_phase_1_slice_7_storage_lifecycle_design_slice_7", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_purge_model_dir", "target": "specs_2026_09_06_folder_tree_and_moves_design_folder_tree", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_migration_0014", "target": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_quarantined_file_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_quarantined_file_table", "target": "specs_2026_09_06_folder_tree_and_moves_design_file_storage_path", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_quarantined_file_table", "target": "specs_2026_09_06_phase_1_slice_7_storage_lifecycle_design_quarantine_timestamp", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_clock_belongs_to_bytes", "target": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_quarantined_file_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_clock_belongs_to_bytes", "target": "specs_2026_09_06_folder_tree_and_moves_design_model_directory_naming", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directory-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_06_phase_1_slice_7_storage_lifecycle_design_purge_recomputes", "target": "specs_2026_09_07_purge_removes_the_model_directory_design_quarantined_file_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-purge-removes-the-model-directo